  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"y equals negative 2.5\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>2.5</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"y equals x squared plus 8 x plus k\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>8</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mi>k</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">In the given system of equations, <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi>\n</math> is a positive integer constant. The system has no real solutions. What is the least possible value of <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi>\n</math>?</p>",
  "answerOptions": [],
